{title: Pehli Mohabbat}
{artist: Ananya Rao}
{composer: Vikram Das}
{lyricist: Neel Kapoor}

{comment: Strumming: D DU UDU}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Pehli mohabbat thi[Am], pehla woh khat tha
[F]Kaanpte haathon se ma[G]ine likha tha
[C]Tere ghar ki khidki, [Am]mera woh intezaar
[F]Kaise bataaun ki[G]tna tha pyaar [C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[F]Yaad hai mujhko, [C]yaad hai sab
[G]Tera woh hansna, ter[Am]a woh rab
[F]Yaad hai mujhko, [C]har ek pal
[G]Kal bhi tha tu, tu hi [C]hai kal
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[C]Ab bhi woh khat rakha [Am]hai kitaab mein
[F]Sookha sa phool hai [G]uske jawaab mein
[C]Waqt guzar gaya, hum b[Am]hi badal gaye
[F]Phir bhi yeh di[G]l wahin reh g[C]aye
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
[F]Yaad hai mujhko, [C]yaad hai sab
[G]Tera woh hansna, ter[Am]a woh rab
[F]Yaad hai mujhko, [C]har ek pal
[G]Kal bhi tha tu, tu hi [C]hai kal
{end_of_verse}
